    "text": "Missoula\nMissoula Man Faces Felony DUI After Parking Lot Incident\nBy Nick Chrestenson,\n4 hours agoMissoula, MT (KGVO-AM News) - On August 2, 2025, a Missoula Police Department officer was dispatched to a report of two disorderly males in the Boone and Crocket parking lot who were honking their horns and saying vulgar things to people passing by. When the officer arrived on scene, she located a vehicle matching the location and description of the reported vehicle. The vehicle was running and playing loud music.",
